@startuml
title RustPython main()에서 사용자 코드 런타임 진입까지\n일반 rustpython script.py / source .py / non-CAPI 기준

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAF9
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 70
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #A8A29E
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDF5
skinparam NoteBorderColor #A8A29E

actor "OS / shell" as OS #E7E5E4
participant "main.rs + lib.rs\nCLI orchestration" as CLI #E0E7FF
participant "InterpreterBuilder" as Builder #DBEAFE
participant "Interpreter / VM\nbootstrap + context" as VM #DFF7F2
participant "file runner\nrun_file / run_any_file" as Loader #FEF3C7
participant "compiler facade\nVM + compiler crate" as Facade #FDE68A
participant "Ruff parser + codegen\nSymbolTable / CFG" as Compiler #F3E8FF
participant "PyFunction +\nInterpreterFrame" as Frame #FCE7F3
participant "ExecutingFrame\nopcode loop" as Eval #FEE2E2

autonumber

== 1. 프로세스 설정과 VM 부트스트랩 ==

OS -> CLI : main()
activate CLI
CLI -> Builder : InterpreterBuilder::new()
CLI -> Builder : init_stdlib()\n(native/frozen modules + init hooks)
CLI -> CLI : rustpython::run(builder)
CLI -> CLI : parse_opts()\n→ (Settings, RunMode::Script(path))
CLI -> Builder : settings(settings)\ninterpreter() → build()
activate Builder
Builder -> VM : initialize_main_vm(...)
activate VM
VM -> VM : PyConfig + PyGlobalState 구성
VM -> VM : VirtualMachine::new(...)
VM -> VM : init hooks 실행
VM -> VM : VmBootstrapGuard + vm.initialize()
note right of VM
  builtins/sys/importlib/encoding/stdio를 준비한다.
  이 부트스트랩 중에도 내부 Python bytecode가 실행될 수 있다.
  아래의 runtime boundary는 "사용자 스크립트" 기준이다.
end note
VM --> Builder : initialized VirtualMachine
deactivate VM
Builder --> CLI : Interpreter
deactivate Builder

CLI -> VM : Interpreter::run(closure)
activate VM
VM -> VM : enter() → thread::enter_vm()
VM -> CLI : run_rustpython(vm, Script(path))

== 2. __main__ 준비와 파일 로딩 ==

CLI -> VM : new_scope_with_main()
VM -> VM : globals + locals + __builtins__\nsys.modules["__main__"] 등록
CLI -> VM : import warnings; import site
CLI -> Loader : run_file(vm, scope, path)
activate Loader
Loader -> Loader : importer 확인 + sys.path[0] 설정
Loader -> VM : run_any_file(scope, path)
VM -> Loader : run_simple_file() / with_simple_run()
Loader -> Loader : __file__ / __cached__ / __loader__ 설정
Loader -> Loader : bytes read → NUL 검사 → UTF-8 String

note over CLI, Loader #FFFBEB
  주요 우회 경로
  - directory/zip: runpy._run_module_as_main
  - .pyc: loader.get_code() 후 컴파일 생략
  - -c: run_string(), -m: run_module(), REPL: shell
  - no-host_env: CLI가 파일을 읽고 run_string() 호출
end note

== 3. source → PyCode 컴파일 ==

Loader -> VM : vm.compile(source, Mode::Exec, path)
VM -> Facade : compile_with_opts(...)
activate Facade
Facade -> Facade : tokenizer/string SyntaxWarning 검사
Facade -> Compiler : compile_with_syntax_warning_handler(...)
activate Compiler
Compiler -> Compiler : SourceFile + Ruff parse\n→ ruff_python_ast::Mod
Compiler -> Compiler : future flags + AST preprocess
Compiler -> Compiler : scan_module_symbols()\ncollect → analyze → SymbolTable
Compiler -> Compiler : Compiler::compile_program()\nAST walk → InstructionInfo / CFG
Compiler -> Compiler : exit_scope() → finalize_code()\noptimize → assemble
Compiler --> Facade : CodeObject<ConstantData>
deactivate Compiler
Facade -> Facade : PyCode::new_ref_from_bytecode()\nmap_bag: constants/names → VM objects
Facade --> VM : PyRef<PyCode>
deactivate Facade
VM --> Loader : PyRef<PyCode>

== 4. 컴파일 산출물에서 평가 루프로 ==

Loader -> VM : run_code_obj(code, scope)
note over Loader, VM #FDF2F8
  runtime boundary
  여기서부터 source/AST가 아니라 PyCode + namespace를 실행한다.
end note
VM -> Frame : PyFunction::new(code, scope.globals, vm)
activate Frame
VM -> Frame : invoke_with_locals(empty_args, scope.locals, vm)

alt 일반 module code + tracing/JIT 없음
    Frame -> Frame : LocalsPlus::new_on_datastack()
    Frame -> Frame : InterpreterFrame::new(...)
    Frame -> VM : run_frame_fast(&mut iframe)
    VM -> VM : with_iframe()\nrecursion guard + current-frame chain
    VM -> Eval : run_iframe() → ExecutingFrame::run(vm)
    activate Eval
    note over VM, Eval #FEF2F2
      eval-loop boundary
      여기서 실제 fetch/decode/dispatch가 시작된다.
    end note
    loop Return / Yield / exception까지
        Eval -> Eval : read_op(idx) + read_arg(idx)
        Eval -> Eval : trace/signal/GC safepoint 검사
        Eval -> Eval : execute_instruction(op, arg, vm)
    end
    Eval --> VM : ExecutionResult::Return(value) / Err(exception)
    deactivate Eval
    VM --> Frame : PyResult
    Frame -> Frame : data stack release
else tracing 활성화
    Frame -> Frame : FrameObject::new_ref(...)
    Frame -> VM : run_frame(frame) → ExecutingFrame::run
else generator / coroutine / async generator
    Frame -> Frame : heap FrameObject 생성
    Frame --> VM : wrapper 반환; 지금은 eval loop에 들어가지 않음
    note right of Frame
      이후 send/await 때 resume_gen_frame을 통해 실행한다.
    end note
end

Frame --> VM : PyResult
deactivate Frame
VM --> Loader : 실행 결과
deactivate Loader
VM --> CLI : run_rustpython 결과
VM -> VM : Interpreter::finalize()\nflush → exception/exit code → atexit → GC/modules
VM --> CLI : u32 exit code
deactivate VM
CLI --> OS : std::process::ExitCode
deactivate CLI

legend left
  |= 경계 |= 의미 |
  | builder.interpreter() | VM이 사용자 실행을 받을 준비 완료 |
  | run_code_obj() | 컴파일 산출물 → 실행 런타임 |
  | run_frame_fast()/run_frame() | 프레임을 현재 호출 체인에 설치 |
  | ExecutingFrame::run() | 바이트코드 평가 루프 시작 |
endlegend

@enduml
